{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "02824",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.28,
      "end_seconds": 7.11,
      "duration_seconds": 5.83,
      "text": "Doctor, hi, where would you like me to put my coat?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 8.29,
      "end_seconds": 11.97,
      "duration_seconds": 3.68,
      "text": "That's fine, sit down. Tell me why you came."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 12.69,
      "end_seconds": 16.44,
      "duration_seconds": 3.75,
      "text": "I've been dealing with periods becoming irregular."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 17.3,
      "end_seconds": 20.16,
      "duration_seconds": 2.86,
      "text": "So, did it come on recently?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 21.1,
      "end_seconds": 26.98,
      "duration_seconds": 5.88,
      "text": "I'd say six months. Actually, no, closer to about a month."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 28.93,
      "end_seconds": 30.87,
      "duration_seconds": 1.94,
      "text": "Any other symptoms with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 31.45,
      "end_seconds": 46.72,
      "duration_seconds": 15.27,
      "text": "Hot flushes goes along with it, you know, most of the time. I've also had poor sleep. With poor sleep, I'd call it moderate. Well, the hot flushes? That's been for two months."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 48.61,
      "end_seconds": 51.71,
      "duration_seconds": 3.1,
      "text": "Right, tell me your medicines, please."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 52.81,
      "end_seconds": 67.36,
      "duration_seconds": 14.55,
      "text": "Pantoprazole. I take it 40 milligrams, before breakfast. I do miss it now and then, to be fair. I'm on hydrocortisone cream, when needed for the eczema."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 81.74,
      "end_seconds": 86.25,
      "duration_seconds": 4.51,
      "text": "Okay, any allergies to tablets, food or anything in the environment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 87.46,
      "end_seconds": 88.85,
      "duration_seconds": 1.39,
      "text": "No known allergies."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 93.67,
      "end_seconds": 99.09,
      "duration_seconds": 5.42,
      "text": "Tell me about your routine, work, habits, that sort of thing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 100.55,
      "end_seconds": 113.28,
      "duration_seconds": 12.73,
      "text": "My husband and I live above the shop. I drink a lot of tea and snack through the day. Not much, I mostly stay in these days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 124.57,
      "end_seconds": 128.36,
      "duration_seconds": 3.79,
      "text": "Any health conditions I should have on record?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 130.29,
      "end_seconds": 136.45,
      "duration_seconds": 6.16,
      "text": "I've got acid reflux. I've had eczema for nearly five years now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 138.13,
      "end_seconds": 146.69,
      "duration_seconds": 8.56,
      "text": "Sure. Alright, acid reflux and eczema, that matches what I have here. Alright, any surgery in the past?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 148.61,
      "end_seconds": 154.73,
      "duration_seconds": 6.12,
      "text": "I had a wisdom tooth extraction under sedation five years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 159.62,
      "end_seconds": 162.85,
      "duration_seconds": 3.23,
      "text": "Any bleeding after sex or pelvic pain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 164.43,
      "end_seconds": 169.13,
      "duration_seconds": 4.7,
      "text": "No bleeding after sex or pelvic pain, none of it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 169.88,
      "end_seconds": 174.41,
      "duration_seconds": 4.53,
      "text": "Right, a few quick ones: very heavy bleeding or weight loss?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 175.8,
      "end_seconds": 181.89,
      "duration_seconds": 6.09,
      "text": "Um, I haven't had very heavy bleeding or weight loss, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 182.36,
      "end_seconds": 187.44,
      "duration_seconds": 5.08,
      "text": "Mm, okay. Anything with your heart, like skipped beats or fainting?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 188.01,
      "end_seconds": 190.31,
      "duration_seconds": 2.3,
      "text": "No, that's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 191.17,
      "end_seconds": 195.44,
      "duration_seconds": 4.27,
      "text": "Can I check a few measurements before we carry on?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 206.84,
      "end_seconds": 209.03,
      "duration_seconds": 2.19,
      "text": "Okay, this won't take long..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 228.19,
      "end_seconds": 236.99,
      "duration_seconds": 8.8,
      "text": "Okay: SpO2 99 percent on room air, heart rate 86, temp 36.8 degrees, BP is 124 over 70."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 238.15,
      "end_seconds": 240.25,
      "duration_seconds": 2.1,
      "text": "May I examine you now?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 255.59,
      "end_seconds": 257.33,
      "duration_seconds": 1.74,
      "text": "Yes, that's fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 258.22,
      "end_seconds": 259.56,
      "duration_seconds": 1.34,
      "text": "Look straight ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 271.39,
      "end_seconds": 275.47,
      "duration_seconds": 4.08,
      "text": "Your blood pressure is normal and the abdomen is soft."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 277.62,
      "end_seconds": 312.4,
      "duration_seconds": 34.78,
      "text": "You can sit up now. Taking everything into account, I'd lean towards perimenopause. I'll request a blood count, it'll help with irregular periods. It's a routine test and it'll give us a much clearer picture. I'm going to order a thyroid test, for hot flushes. I'm prescribing estradiol gel, 1 pump, once a day, long term. That's for menopausal symptoms. Regular exercise, light layers and avoiding triggers can help. I'd like you back in three months."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 314.31,
      "end_seconds": 316.83,
      "duration_seconds": 2.52,
      "text": "Have I covered everything you wanted?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 317.55,
      "end_seconds": 322.34,
      "duration_seconds": 4.79,
      "text": "Yeah, you know, great, thank you for your help."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 323.24,
      "end_seconds": 324.61,
      "duration_seconds": 1.37,
      "text": "Take care now."
    }
  ]
}